      "source_name": "completionDecision_some_formula",
      "statement": "∀ {X : Type u_1} {I : Type u_2} {J : Type u_3} [inst : Fintype I] [inst_1 : Fintype J] (R : X → Option I → ℕ)\n  (P : X → Option J → ℕ) (x y : X) (A : OAI.ContingencyTables.Table (R x) (P x)),\n  OAI.ContingencyTables.CompletionTranslation.completionDecision R P x (some y) A =\n    if\n        ∀ (i : Option I) (j : Option J),\n          0 ≤ ↑(↑A i j) + OAI.ContingencyTables.CompletionTranslation.between (R x) (R y) (P x) (P y) i j then\n      y\n    else x"
